  "thag1.18:1.1": "Ahū buddhassa dāyādo ",
  "thag1.18:1.2": "bhikkhu Bhesakaḷāvane, ",
  "thag1.18:1.3": "kevalaṃ aṭṭhisaññāya ",
  "thag1.18:1.4": "aphari paṭhaviṃ imaṃ. ",
  "thag1.18:1.5": "maññe 'haṃ kāmarāgaṃ so ",
  "thag1.18:1.6": "khippam eva pahīyatīti. ",
  "thag1.18:1.7": "Udakaṃ hi "
}
